2026 has seen SydJS taken on many new ideas. New durations. New speaker format. So as we close out the year, it’s time for another new idea.

SydJS’s last meeting of the year will be in conjunction with the crew from Open Source Social.

Meet old friends. Make new friends.

We’re breaking out of the meeting room and doubling down on the IRL

Grab an RSVP from Humanitix and get social!

